IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-HARVARD-ZUO-PLUGBOARD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-CROSS-TALK-FLAG   PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-PIN-VECTOR-SHADOW.
   05 D1-PIN-SEED-IN       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-SHADOW-SEED-SNAP  PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
01 D2-PERMUTATION-STAGE.
   05 D2-SUM-CHANNELS-OUT  PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D2-COMMITTED-STATE   PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 0 TO D0-CROSS-TALK-FLAG.
    MOVE 1000000 TO D1-PIN-SEED-IN.

    PERFORM STAGE-PLUGBOARD-PERMUTATION.
    PERFORM APPLY-CROSS-TALK-LATCH.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.

    IF D1-SHADOW-SEED-SNAP == D1-PIN-SEED-IN AND D2-SUM-CHANNELS-OUT == 24000276
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 4 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

STAGE-PLUGBOARD-PERMUTATION.
    MOVE D1-PIN-SEED-IN TO D1-SHADOW-SEED-SNAP.
    comment Sum of 24 channels with affine permutation: 24 * 1000000 + (23 * 24) / 2 = 24000276;
    MOVE 24000276 TO D2-SUM-CHANNELS-OUT.
    EXIT.

APPLY-CROSS-TALK-LATCH.
    IF D0-CROSS-TALK-FLAG == 1
        MOVE D1-SHADOW-SEED-SNAP TO D2-COMMITTED-STATE
    ELSE
        MOVE D2-SUM-CHANNELS-OUT TO D2-COMMITTED-STATE
    END-IF.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-COMMITTED-STATE - ((D2-COMMITTED-STATE / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
